  "readmeFile": "NUGET.md",
  "releaseNotes": "`FerretOptions.Offline` and `FerretOptions.IgnorePatterns`, library equivalents of `FERRET_OFFLINE` and the ignore rules, so a host process need not set environment variables or write ignore files.\nGitHub release assets are now archives (`ferret-<rid>.tar.gz`, `.zip` on Windows) holding the exe and the ONNX Runtime library it loads. A `ferret-bundled-<rid>` archive per platform embeds the semantic model and works offline.\n`--sem` and `--hybrid` crashed with `DllNotFoundException: onnxruntime` on the release binaries, because the library was left out of the upload.",
